{
    "chapter_num": 1,
    "verses_count": 28,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Vision of the Chariot"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "In the thirtieth year, in the fourth month, on the fifth day of the month, as I was among the exiles by the river Chebar, the heavens were opened, and I saw visions of God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "On the fifth day of the month (it was the fifth year of the exile of King Jehoi′achin), "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the word of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "SMALL_CAPS",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " came to Ezekiel the priest, the son of Buzi, in the land of the Chalde′ans by the river Chebar; and the hand of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "SMALL_CAPS",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " was upon him there."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "As I looked, behold, a stormy wind came out of the north, and a great cloud, with brightness round about it, and fire flashing forth continually, and in the midst of the fire, as it were gleaming bronze. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And from the midst of it came the likeness of four living creatures. And this was their appearance: they had the form of men, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but each had four faces, and each of them had four wings. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Their legs were straight, and the soles of their feet were like the sole of a calf’s foot; and they sparkled like burnished bronze. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Under their wings on their four sides they had human hands. And the four had their faces and their wings thus: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "their wings touched one another; they went every one straight forward, without turning as they went. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "As for the likeness of their faces, each had the face of a man in front;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Cn: Heb lacks in front"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the four had the face of a lion on the right side, the four had the face of an ox on the left side, and the four had the face of an eagle at the back."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Cn: Heb lacks at the back"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Such were their faces. And their wings were spread out above; each creature had two wings, each of which touched the wing of another, while two covered their bodies. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And each went straight forward; wherever the spirit would go, they went, without turning as they went. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "In the midst of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Gk Old Latin: Heb And the likeness of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the living creatures there was something that looked like burning coals of fire, like torches moving to and fro among the living creatures; and the fire was bright, and out of the fire went forth lightning. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the living creatures darted to and fro, like a flash of lightning."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now as I looked at the living creatures, I saw a wheel upon the earth beside the living creatures, one for each of the four of them."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Heb of their faces"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "As for the appearance of the wheels and their construction: their appearance was like the gleaming of a chrysolite; and the four had the same likeness, their construction being as it were a wheel within a wheel. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When they went, they went in any of their four directions"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Heb on their four sides"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " without turning as they went. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The four wheels had rims and they had spokes;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Cn: Heb uncertain"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and their rims were full of eyes round about. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when the living creatures went, the wheels went beside them; and when the living creatures rose from the earth, the wheels rose. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Wherever the spirit would go, they went, and the wheels rose along with them; for the spirit of the living creatures was in the wheels. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When those went, these went; and when those stood, these stood; and when those rose from the earth, the wheels rose along with them; for the spirit of the living creatures was in the wheels."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Over the heads of the living creatures there was the likeness of a firmament, shining like crystal,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Gk: Heb awesome crystal"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " spread out above their heads. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And under the firmament their wings were stretched out straight, one toward another; and each creature had two wings covering its body. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when they went, I heard the sound of their wings like the sound of many waters, like the thunder of the Almighty, a sound of tumult like the sound of a host; when they stood still, they let down their wings. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And there came a voice from above the firmament over their heads; when they stood still, they let down their wings."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And above the firmament over their heads there was the likeness of a throne, in appearance like sapphire;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Heb lapis lazuli"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and seated above the likeness of a throne was a likeness as it were of a human form. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And upward from what had the appearance of his loins I saw as it were gleaming bronze, like the appearance of fire enclosed round about; and downward from what had the appearance of his loins I saw as it were the appearance of fire, and there was brightness round about him."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Like the appearance of the bow that is in the cloud on the day of rain, so was the appearance of the brightness round about."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Such was the appearance of the likeness of the glory of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "SMALL_CAPS",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". And when I saw it, I fell upon my face, and I heard the voice of one speaking."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}